\newlabel{tab:dataset-formats}{{1}{5}{Dataset format categories for entropy measurement}{table.1}{}}
\newlabel{tab:h-e1-metrics}{{2}{8}{H-E1 validation metrics. Entropy computation technically successful (100\% success rate, all values within valid range [0, ln(2)] $\approx $ [0, 0.693] nats), but dataset format yielded constant value H = 0.6931 nats (exactly ln(2)) across all prompts, resulting in zero variance. Gate outcome: PARTIAL\_FAILURE (mechanism works, dataset-methodology mismatch)}{table.2}{}}
